{"title":"Career roadmap — Performer","role":"Performer","summary":"A Performer works professionally in dance, theatre, stage productions, live entertainment, film, television, digital media, cultural productions and performance-based education.","facts":{"Current degree":"BA (Bachelor of Arts – General / Honours)","Course":"Dance / Theatre / Performing Arts"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A successful performer needs more than artistic talent. The strongest career combines technical performance ability + physical conditioning + acting/expression + audition skills + portfolio development + networking + professional business skills."}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Build performance technique, stage confidence, repertoire, physical conditioning and professional portfolio"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Establish a professional identity and specialise in dance, theatre, musical theatre, film, television or live entertainment"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Progress toward lead performer, choreographer, performer-trainer, ensemble leader or independent artist"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Build an independent artistic career, production company, performance school, cultural organisation or creative brand"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Performance foundations"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Core dance/theatre technique"},{"text":"Body conditioning"},{"text":"Flexibility"},{"text":"Strength"},{"text":"Rhythm"},{"text":"Voice control"},{"text":"Facial expression"},{"text":"Stage presence"},{"text":"Movement awareness"},{"text":"Improvisation"},{"text":"Performance discipline"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Choose a primary discipline:"},{"type":"h","text":"Dance / Theatre /